# Directories excluded from the Mod+Space launcher (~/.config/niri/scripts/launch_menu.py).
#
# Syntax is .gitignore format -- this file is handed straight to `fd --ignore-file`,
# so anything gitignore accepts works here (negate with a leading `!`).
#
# Applies to the PDF sweep over ~/Dropbox, ~/Downloads and ~/Documents only.
# Applications and Obsidian notes are never filtered by this file.
#
# A bare name (`backups/`) matches a directory of that name at any depth and is
# case-sensitive. A pattern with an inner slash is anchored, and an anchored
# pattern here silently matches nothing (`Dropbox/archive/` excludes zero files),
# so prefix path patterns with `**/`. Verified independent of the launcher's cwd.
#
# Course, service, review and project `archive/` folders are deliberately searchable.
# Only the two below are excluded: a personal dumping ground, and generated figures.
#
# ~/Dropbox/references/library is not excluded wholesale. The script skips only
# PDFs it already lists as references.bib rows (author/title rather than filename);
# un-cited papers and appendices in the library still appear as documents.

backups/
obsidian_mirror_readonly/
**/Dropbox/archive/
**/strategic-aid/Code_optimized/output/archive/
